## Rules

- Prefer the boring option that fits the project's real scale. Add machinery only when a real force demands it, and name the force.
- If you discover a problem in the existing architecture, report it. Do not silently fix it.
<!-- kit:if has.db -->
- If a change needs several migrations, propose the full sequence and apply only the first one the brief approves.
<!-- kit:end -->
